      "derivationNotes": "Same layout chrome as HabitDetail (sidebar, header, content max 1120px) but in form-creation mode. Replace the heatmap/history panels with a single centered Habit form card containing: Name (text input), Category (select with category color dot pills: Health/Fitness/Learning/Mindfulness/Productivity/Social/Custom), Frequency (Daily / Weekly / Custom days with M T W T F S S toggle pills), Target time (optional time picker + 'Reminders' toggle), Color accent swatch row, Notes (textarea). Heading 'New habit'. Primary button 'Create habit' uses the indigo→emerald gradient. Secondary 'Cancel' link returns to /habits. No streak counter or history sections — they only appear after creation in HabitDetail."
